        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Community Counts! Subs for Santa</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/49675.webp" alt="Community Counts! Subs for Santa" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>Why does&nbsp;<strong><em>Subs for Santa</em></strong>&nbsp;matter?&nbsp;&nbsp;Many living in our community would be quick to say that&nbsp;<strong><em>Subs for Santa</em></strong>&nbsp;brings our Valley together as one to help one another in our times of need.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p>In 1989,&nbsp;<strong><em>Subs for Santa</em></strong>&nbsp;was born because of a need to help a family in our community.&nbsp;&nbsp;A group of volunteers put together a Christmas for this family.&nbsp;&nbsp;The single mother of three wanted to give back to the generous community that made Christmas&nbsp;possible for her children.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p>Once she got back on her feet, she made Christmas possible for many other needy families.&nbsp;&nbsp;This volunteer was Jan Hall.&nbsp;&nbsp;Jan inspired others to take a stand.&nbsp;&nbsp;As time went on, it was clear that the need extended beyond Christmas.&nbsp;&nbsp;It was soon realized that&nbsp;<strong><em>Subs for Santa</em></strong>&nbsp;needed to be a year-round program.&nbsp;&nbsp;Gogie Reynolds joined the force and lead the program to include Easter, back-to-school, Thanksgiving, and&nbsp;vouchers for special needs.&nbsp;&nbsp;Under her guidance,&nbsp;<strong><em>Subs for Santa</em></strong>&nbsp;has evolved into a full-time entity that is necessary for our valley to thrive.</p>

<p>Teton Valley is constantly growing and life is ever-changing.&nbsp;&nbsp;One constant that&nbsp;remains the same is the generosity and compassion that surrounds the people of our&nbsp;community.&nbsp;&nbsp;This program is comprised of family members and selfless volunteers who want to make a difference in this world.&nbsp;&nbsp;Thanks to the good-hearted people in this Valley,&nbsp;<strong><em>Subs for Santa</em></strong>&nbsp;has helped hundreds of families over the years.&nbsp;&nbsp;Thanks to the support of the churches, schools, businesses, various youth groups, and individuals, this program has been able to grow to meet the ever-expanding needs of Teton Valley.</p>

<p><strong><em>Subs for Santa</em></strong>&nbsp;would like to thank the people of our community and especially those who participate in the Tin Cup Challenge.&nbsp;&nbsp;It has been a true blessing to work with those who make our community what it is.</p>

